        "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
        "body": "Summary\n- Emit codex_plugin_install_suggestion_outcome after a sent plugin or connector install prompt resolves.\n- Reuse the request suggestion ID and initiating turn context so request and outcome remain attributable to the same elicitation.\n- Record selection and completion per tool while retaining aggregate completion for the elicitation.\n- Verify remote plugin completion from the existing installed-plugin refresh result instead of connector availability; the existing Apps-tool refresh remains independent, with no new polling or retries.\n\nStack\n- Depends on #31432, which adds the analytics contract and removes the redundant counter.\n- Release after the server accepts the new analytics event.\n\nValidation\n- just test -p codex-core request_plugin_install (18 passed)",
